{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Step 1: Select your wealth and aura</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3263330/extras/vlcsnap-2025-04-17-12h00m17s722.png?t=1744917097\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Landmine Princess is all about stats predetermined by your situation, like real life. You will inevitably nerd out about these stats. Maybe even obsessive over them. Because those eight magic numbers on the top screen changes. If you truly want it more straightforward, pretend you are selecting difficulty.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u00a0</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Step 2: Select Your date</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3263330/extras/vlcsnap-2025-04-17-11h50m13s395.png?t=1744917097\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Mina is an interesting girl who wants to be with you. She will do some small talk and then you get a date selection. There are a total of 32 dates in this game, each with their own dialogue, music, and landmine game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Step 3: PLAY THE LANDMINE DATE</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3263330/extras/vlcsnap-2025-04-17-12h01m31s809.png?t=1744917097\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">What is the landmine game? You are simply asked to move along a grid as the timer reaches 0. Some tiles are safe. Some tiles will boost stats. Some tiles might be a landmine. Every movement changes Mina's stats, and she converses with you throughout the date, reacting to the way you carry yourself through the grid.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Step 4: Answer tough questions</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3263330/extras/vlcsnap-2025-04-17-11h50m43s016.png?t=1744917097\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Mina is a landmine girl! She has some very heavy questions for you pertaining to various dating topics such as commitment, starting a family, exes, cheating, social anxiety, and other surprise topics. Your answer to these questions will determine how Mina will react. They will also help you towards boosting your stats to win her affection.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Step 5: Repeat 4 times</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3263330/extras/vlcsnap-2025-04-11-20h23m45s546.png?t=1744917097\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Here is the rogue element and the proposal. Mina knows the type of person you are. She still chose you. However you need to prove your worth in five dates. Every date will get more difficult. There will be more landmines. The questions will hit harder. And Mina's resentment can only grow so much.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Step 6: Earn one of 32 possible endings</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3263330/extras/Date7Leash.png?t=1744917097\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Based on your stats there are:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">8 Conventionally Happy Monogamous Endings</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">8 Break-up Endings</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">8 NTR (VERY BAD) Endings</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">8 NTS (Mystery) Endings</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The endings are all over the place. Some of them are poetic that you can use on a date or stuff you can do like whisper promises in their ears. Some endings are very sad. They may resonate very personally and we apologize for that. Some are not only very sad but also very humorous. Some are just plain sad. Some endings are...unique. They probably make sense for people into them. This was the first Jeistar Dating Sim.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Two Modes</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Rogue:</strong> Your stats stay with you for every rerun. If you are bad at dates, this is for you. You basically have to handle a lot of rejection before finally getting the happy ending.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Old School:</strong> Your stats reset every game. Just like real life, you get only one shot at Mina based on your stats. If you nerd out about stats, you can pull this off.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Original Soundtrack</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Lastly as this is a Jeistar Game, it will have its own original soundttrack, carrying sounds from the second volume of Liminal Void's OST with a more post-punk and pop centered sound.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3263330?t=1744917097","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3263330?t=1744917097","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3263330/273a40fc9dff5dd14c6ca79656824339c932b3d5/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1744917097","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3263330/273a40fc9dff5dd14c6ca79656824339c932b3d5/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1744917097","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[5],"notes":"This is a dating sim with lots of swearing and talking of sex acts. No sex acts are depicted, however."},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Step 1: Select your wealth and aura</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_im