ragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Two Modes</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Rogue:</strong> Your stats stay with you for every rerun. If you are bad at dates, this is for you. You basically have to handle a lot of rejection before finally getting the happy ending.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Old School:</strong> Your stats reset every game. Just like real life, you get only one shot at Mina based on your stats. If you nerd out about stats, you can pull this off.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Original Soundtrack</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Lastly as this is a Jeistar Game, it will have its own original soundttrack, carrying sounds from the second volume of Liminal Void's OST with a more post-punk and pop centered sound.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p>","developers":["Jeistar"],"genres":[{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Simulation","id":"28"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3263330/0ca95a7ea7d68621c318d86345327dd5a99c7736/header.jpg?t=1744917097","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"highlight":true,"id":257125188,"mp4":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257125188/movie480.mp4?t=1744657234","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257125188/movie_max.mp4?t=1744657234"},"name":"Trailer 1","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257125188/aedc6fd46537c5481ecb1c44cf9a95f9a73ca15a/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1744657234","webm":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257125188/movie480_vp9.webm?t=1744657234","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257125188/movie_max_vp9.webm?t=1744657234"}}],"name":"Landmine Princess","package_groups":[],"pc_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong